  "description": "You don't want to cruise, you want to blast through – even on gravel? Then the Asket CF Full Party is your gravel bike. The carbon frame is light, stiff, and simply fast. The electronic SRAM drivetrain shifts gears so smoothly you'll almost forget you're pedaling. And the RockShox Rudy suspension fork eats roots and bumpy roads for breakfast. Thanks to carbon components, the weight stays low – and the performance high. This bike is for ambitious gravel riders who don't want to make any compromises. A full party, in other words – just like we would ride it ourselves.",
